# Project Overview

This repo is going to be used as a repo for an AI Upskills Workshop at The Walt Disney Company.

The main tool we will use for the workshop is Cursor 2.0.

The workshop-slides.md file is a Markup Presentation Ecosystem (MARP) presentation.

All contents added to these slides should follow the establioshed formatting.

Do not allow contents to overflow in a slide.

All contents in the presentation should apply to Cursor 2.0 features.

There are hands-on labs that will be facilitated in the workshop to allow users first-hand experience with Cursor features.
